#: gameservermonitor.py:1803
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Adds a server to monitor its status.\n"
"\n"
"        **General usage:**\n"
"        `[p]addserver <ip[:port]> <game> [#channel] [domain]`\n"
"\n"
"        **Source games with a separate query port (e.g. Rust with +queryport):**\n"
"        `[p]addserver <ip:game_port> <game> <game_port> <query_port> [#channel] [domain]`\n"
"        The A2S query is sent to `query_port`; players still connect to `game_port`.\n"
"\n"
"        **DayZ usage (separate ports):**\n"
"        `[p]addserver <ip> dayz <game_port> <query_port> [#channel] [domain]`\n"
"\n"
"        **Supported games:** cs2, css, gmod, rust, minecraft, dayz, valheim, ark, tf2, l4d2, 7dtd, palworld\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Añade un servidor para monitorizar su estado.\n"
"\n"
"        **Uso general:**\n"
"        `[p]addserver <ip[:puerto]> <juego> [#canal] [dominio]`\n"
"\n"
"        **Juegos Source con puerto de query separado (ej. Rust con +queryport):**\n"
"        `[p]addserver <ip:puerto_juego> <juego> <puerto_juego> <puerto_query> [#canal] [dominio]`\n"
"        La query A2S se envía a `puerto_query`; los jugadores siguen conectándose a `puerto_juego`.\n"
"\n"
"        **Uso DayZ (puertos separados):**\n"
"        `[p]addserver <ip> dayz <puerto_juego> <puerto_query> [#canal] [dominio]`\n"
"\n"
"        **Juegos soportados:** cs2, css, gmod, rust, minecraft, dayz, valheim, ark, tf2, l4d2, 7dtd, palworld\n"
"        "

