#: gameservermonitor.py:2029
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Removes servers that stopped responding, after confirmation.\n"
"\n"
"        Stops the monitor from querying servers that no longer exist, which is\n"
"        what floods the logs with timeouts. Deletes their status embed and their\n"
"        player history too.\n"
"\n"
"        Use `[p]deadservers` first for a dry run.\n"
"\n"
"        Example: `[p]purgeservers 14`\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Elimina los servidores que dejaron de responder, tras confirmación.\n"
"\n"
"        Evita que el monitor siga consultando servidores que ya no existen,\n"
"        que es lo que llena los logs de timeouts. Elimina también su embed\n"
"        de estado y su historial de jugadores.\n"
"\n"
"        Usa `[p]deadservers` primero para ver la lista sin borrar nada.\n"
"\n"
"        Ejemplo: `[p]purgeservers 14`\n"
"        "

